# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Category D: Observability Infrastructure (Prometheus & Grafana Images - Gate 6.4.4a)
# Technical Justification: Upstream OSS monitoring containers. Both containers run
# isolated on the omninovel-internal network (127.0.0.1 bind-only, zero edge ingress).
# All listed CVEs affect unused remote-read engines or unused bundled plugins (Tempo,
# Alertmanager, Graphite).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
